 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Skate Holic!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "すけーとほりっく！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sachi, a first-year university student, became interested in skateboarding after watching a video her brother was watching. While skating, she made a mistake and nearly hit a passing woman with her skateboard, injuring her, but the woman caught her skateboard and gracefully stopped it on the spot. This woman's name was Kurisu. The meeting of these two women marks the beginning of a lively and fun girls' skateboarding memorial for female university students...!\n\n(Source: Champion Cross, translated)",
   "ja": "兄が見ていた動画がきっかけにスケボーに興味を持った大学1年生の幸。彼女は滑った時のミスで危うく通りすがりの女性にスケボーをぶつけてケガをさせそうになってしまうが、その女性はスケボーを受けたかと思うとその場で華麗に滑って止めて見せた。この女性の名前は紅莉栖。この2人の出会いによって、女子大生たちの賑やかで楽しいガールズ・スケートボード・メモリアルが幕を開ける…！"
  },
